      "It does not invert anything. To make your own model from a magnetic or gravity survey, use Mag / gravity inversion; for IP lines, DC / IP.",
      "OMF files (Leapfrog, Seequent) have their own pane, Open Mining Format. VTK files and Geosoft voxels (.geosoft_voxel) are not read; export the model from its software as a UBC mesh and model, or as a block-model CSV.",
